      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I know I say this every time we talk...but I’ll say it\nagain!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nHey there. I’m a color contacts designer! Maybe\nyou’ve even used some of my designs?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 154
    },
    {
      "displayText": "One of my customers was telling me the other\nday that Medicham has perfected the art of yoga!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nIsn’t that amazing?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 121
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I guess for Medicham, it’s less Mega Evolution\nand more...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200067007500650073007300200066006F00720020004D006500640069006300680061006D002C002000690074201900730020006C0065007300730020004D006500670061002000450076006F006C007500740069006F006E000A0061006E00640020006D006F00720065002E002E002E00100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yoga Evolution...?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00670061002000450076006F006C007500740069006F006E002E002E002E003F00100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I wanna see it! I gotta see a Mega Medicham!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000770061006E006E0061002000730065006500200069007400210020004900200067006F0074007400610020007300650065002000610020004D0065006700610020004D006500640069006300680061006D002100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "For our last battle, please show me the Mega\nEvolution of Medicham!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006F00720020006F007500720020006C00610073007400200062006100740074006C0065002C00200070006C0065006100730065002000730068006F00770020006D006500200074006800650020004D006500670061000A00450076006F006C007500740069006F006E0020006F00660020004D006500640069006300680061006D002100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I think you can get Medicham’s Mega Stone at\nthe Stone Emporium.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020007400680069006E006B00200079006F0075002000630061006E00200067006500740020004D006500640069006300680061006D201900730020004D006500670061002000530074006F006E0065002000610074000A007400680065002000530074006F006E006500200045006D0070006F007200690075006D002E00100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "For our final battle, I want to see a Mega\nMedicham! You’ll need a Medicham with you.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "For our final battle, I want to see a Mega\nMedicham!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBut your Medicham isn’t holding its Mega Stone!\nIt can’t Mega Evolve without it, you know.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 151
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Show me a Mega Medicham in our battle!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530068006F00770020006D0065002000610020004D0065006700610020004D006500640069006300680061006D00200069006E0020006F0075007200200062006100740074006C0065002100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sure thing!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530075007200650020007400680069006E006700210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wait a bit",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570061006900740020006100200062006900740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please! I need inspiration to make fresh, new\ncolor contacts for everyone!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Your Mega Medicham is sure to open my mind\nand help me create new color contacts!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There’s no point in us battling if you don’t show\nme a Mega Medicham! We need to try again!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Medicham was so incredible... It blew all the\ninspiration I had straight out of my head!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The only things I can think of right now are...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800650020006F006E006C00790020007400680069006E0067007300200049002000630061006E0020007400680069006E006B0020006F00660020007200690067006800740020006E006F00770020006100720065002E002E002E00100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Poké Balls for Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F006B00E9002000420061006C006C007300200066006F007200200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And the cyberspace Boxes where you store them!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E006400200074006800650020006300790062006500720073007000610063006500200042006F00780065007300200077006800650072006500200079006F0075002000730074006F007200650020007400680065006D002100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m ready to deliver a whole new experience to\neach and every color contacts fanatic in Lumiose!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You received color contacts in new designs:\n“Poké Ball” and “cyber”!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200072006500630065006900760065006400200063006F006C006F007200200063006F006E0074006100630074007300200069006E0020006E00650077002000640065007300690067006E0073003A000A201C0050006F006B00E9002000420061006C006C201D00200061006E00640020201C00630079006200650072201D00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you so much for all your help!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nFrom now on, I’ll do my best to Mega Evolve my\nown Pokémon for inspiration.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 120
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Try out all the different color contacts you have!\nIf you find a set you like, why not take a selfie?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3596,
